buted the most soon felt the most  proud of being able to actually come up  with that idea and build the launch box  from scratch on my own makes it really  really important to me the Internet  community is pretty special to me it's a  large group of people but what makes it  special is that we're all interested in  growing creatively and we're all really  supportive of each other's individual  projects I definitely want to keep  expanding infinite  making it more visible not only at MIT I  also want to start reaching out into  Boston area and just put MIT on the map  as a place to be for you know fashion  design  [Music]
 

